                    "message": "```\n${xpath_unresolved_button} already exists at line 35 with the XPath //button[contains(normalize-space(.),\"Unresolve\")].\n```\n\n Replace ${xpath_event_logs_unresolve} in the new test case with the existing ${xpath_unresolved_button} and remove the duplicate variable declaration."
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/logs_and_services_menu/test_event_logs_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 41,
                    "reviewer": {
